<div style="text-align: center;">
<blockquote>
<p>Every act of creation is first an act of destruction - Pablo Picasso</p>
</blockquote>
</div>
<p>I would like to request two things from our audience:</p>
<p>First, if you post to the discussion, please do not comment as a reply to this first post, as I wish to allow my contributors to have their say displayed alongside mine.</p>
<p>Second, to those who I have spoken to and know what's going on here&#8230; don't spoil the mystery :p</p>
<p><strong>This is intended to be solved. Good luck.</strong></p>
<p>To critters: Tone is intentional. SPAG is not.</p>
<hr />
<p>This is a passion project that is well over a year in the making. It has been somewhat of a struggle, as I had originally aspired to call on the writing prowess of people whose work I hold in very high regard &#8212; it did not quite come to fruition. Nevertheless, I would like to thank djkaktus, TheGreatHippo, Kalinin, Metaphysician, PeppersGhost, et al for their interest and support in pursuing this work.</p>
<p>I would also like to thank my contributors, without whom this article could not have been given life. Modern_Erasmus, TheeSherm, TheVolgun, and Woedenaz, who all came onto the project pretty much last minute and have gone above-and-beyond in terms of producing stellar work on an incredibly restrictive schedule.</p>
<p>I would like to thank everyone who has taken the time to review this since its inception. I have to note, however, that I was fairly deceptive in shopping this around in the early stages &#8212; many people only read a small piece of the article at any given time not knowing the larger work it was attached to. If you read this and recognize a section you read, then please let me know so I may include you in the credits.</p>
